<headline>TABLE - OUTDOOR COMMUNICATIONS SELLS SNR SUB NOTES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Outdoor Communuications Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER OUTDOOR COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>AMT $105 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 8/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SR SUB NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/1998 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 9.25 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 287	  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: The issue has a three-year equity call for 1/3 of the issue at 109.25.</p>
<p>(( Hugh Bronstein, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1660))</p>
